01:07:09.140 --> 01:07:16.340
Down here are the targets. So here is where we call funk with parameter 0. We load the parameter. We

01:07:16.820 --> 01:07:25.700
jump to tjl funk to actually do the work. Here we have the jump table and this is encoded as a set of

01:07:25.700 --> 01:07:37.540
